WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.248
Job three: make things better.

2
00:00:03.298 --> 00:00:11.991
Vanderbilt is asking every team to move faster and improve, and that happens in your team, in small ways,

3
00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:19.069
every week. Four habits. Explain the why, in your own words, before the announcement.

4
00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:23.316
Describe where the team is going, in two sentences.

5
00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:32.392
Let people try: two weeks, then show me. Look back: ten minutes after big work, what worked and what changes.

6
00:00:32.442 --> 00:00:35.806
This week, hold one ten-minute look-back.

